Build a distributed system that will allow users login, browse list of frequently used cities and for selected city retrieve current weather. It should consist of two microservices. One should provide capability to login (fixed list of username and password, first user wad/password) and collection of known cities per user. User should login and then be able to retrieve cities and check weather per city. Second service for provided city name retrieves weather from this external graftcode based service API https://dotnetweatherapi.onrender.com/ and returns to the user. Frontend should be web app providing mentioned user capabilities.